  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Promoting School (HPS) Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The HPS initiative advocates for a holistic approach to enhance student health, integrating essential policy reforms, curricular updates and community-based interventions. By addressing tobacco use, physical activity, nutrition, and mental health, the program empowers stakeholders including students, teachers, and families to lead healthier lifestyles. This collaborative approach also strengthens the school and community partnership, contributing to the UN&#x2019;s sustainable development agenda, particularly in fostering health and well-being practices in education systems.</narrative>
  </description>
